{
  "4": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e03fd3fbb2233225ae954cd4363e003d22f05c58d2ace900529ea14cee069794",
      "text": "Sorry to trouble you both, having\nyou come out here as reserve forces\nlike this...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "7": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bede7cd643f0e27210bdfae04f482bd7b75e8c35472bcdf9478c0c273fe2fdd4",
      "text": "Not at all. Monsters overflowing\nfrom the labyrinth's branches\nconcern us as well.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "10": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:72fb2bbbf15757765b7b7c6a7e1570814a7a4cae431f522656ec53af9db837f1",
      "text": "Is it really okay for us to just\nstand by like this?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "13": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9d9de5c945b90de0bc65c676cdcc172c2df55ae74c839687cf411fd58b0bbd25",
      "text": "We're fine unless something serious\nhappens. Actually, a really remarkable\ngirl joined us as a trainee recently.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "16": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:805072fb03228c7d843c70818984d6a63e4252e83e9f4b4d888cf4a01df2d14b",
      "text": "Damn, this thing...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "21": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:44449a4d89da82d0ac38929de8b253ef650b9e901fa081bf21441d0665b5e76a",
      "text": "Stand back!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "25": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ecd055b47606bcc4f6de6413f9c60cff903400041d1dbca8ce6d5597c4c063a3",
      "text": "A flustered mind is a poor blade.\nCalm yourself, then return to the\nfront line.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "30": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b9926b5a6e330fa2390446ee4e6ab18f65ee7857a1917adb5f93315a1d1c1df9",
      "text": "—I'll handle this.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "33": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e31b0fb5614cb922786fbffb527c2c23084e4a3001d7f1b46bcade23b7429a21",
      "text": "Thanks! Nagiri!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "37": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:436bc2e0210a9293b5638480a34c14b6b64acc181852ddd32604e9b43be1b698",
      "text": "One heart, one blade... Amo Style,\nhere I come!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "39": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8f98ee433bb5b48140f8083294e081f2cf9c8c56875fa690088afa75e23d49bc",
      "text": "Heaven's Thunder, One Flash.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "43": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4453c86832f972f0cc8504e8dbf0a219ad316cb077236cb0fdf4ae9b420139d6",
      "text": "...S-so cool...! And she's\nJapanese, too?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "46": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:944dbfc85e90dd1c08970e5cf7f3da7f42f8c3fef224b629cebf0388eb9cca1b",
      "text": "Magnificent... Not just her powers,\nbut real swordsmanship.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "49": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1fbaf3ed1da23a4df0401ecaa79638d44d1063f5863e42ccc1dd00999d18e5cb",
      "text": "Impressive, right? That's our\nnewcomer, Nagiri Amo. She'll be a\nfull knight before long.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "52": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:857d2a51605c458bd743107d578f49dad090aa9eba84c16275096a395ec70896",
      "text": "Wow... Seriously impressive...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "58": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b169b8da74b1b2aa973bee66fa6c2ba00cddfab97e1cc2e164bb1128e68ca55a",
      "text": "Well. We didn't get to do anything\ntoday.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "62": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8d067de3bd5ec526484371a91505d646ac820025cbc6121073987196e8e81b38",
      "text": "Is that so?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "66": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:57619b8d261b42a6d6e7093df763c8321efe54f0cf95ef067d204a741c1dce05",
      "text": "There was a remarkable girl. Well,\na peaceful ending is a good thing.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "70": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:632432fe86b5c38c95315f79fb7512be2f4f35b5a31f65dceb856edb0baa4f50",
      "text": "That's right. And it's because you\nwere on standby that the rest of us\ncould give it our all.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "76": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:04b77cb0fc741a01ebef5d72d06bdc6be2a6a01ca3558aac4bb3efd09298eab1",
      "text": "Forgive my late greeting. I am\nNagiri Amo, a provisional member of\nthe Guild Knights.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "79": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7f93002079ffe5a4964abb7bd35256047b5aeafbba18d160f94f672dfaa206a0",
      "text": "I have heard much about you from my\nfriend... Yae. I am glad to meet\nyou. Alk, Light, Stella.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "83": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:afc51bbe0c8bf0385b89c48497eaf983e2c3acd9b6cda8ba1f21f1c699d26142",
      "text": "...Oh! You're the \"cool friend\"\nAsato mentioned!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "87": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6903ac07bb4eafa01dd95a9105a7840eadfedcfe2430ef7c873c8fba1e5603c4",
      "text": "She said that about me...?\nHonestly, Yae...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "91": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:50dc4dc9a5a427287ea13c6da47ce2ef9c4444d0d87f456c2963ced9b75588b9",
      "text": "I got provisional membership once\ntoo. But will you become a full\nmember, Amo?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "94": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:05f08fb5e57b26df0fe2f60ff3840034241b24a3a538f354fc3e1e4fb220e817",
      "text": "Yes. Once things settle down, I am\nto join the Guild Knights.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "97": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7e70efc915ff2cf41935efff251b31fcbb07d4214cd68c5011431d2483c3131c",
      "text": "...This is the future you all\ncarried forward for me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "101": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:989a735f26ea26b701a0a036de50f6b475f05f1a57ce2d3ba71fb394185a91eb",
      "text": "A day apart is like a thousand\nautumns. I have long wished to thank\nyou. Allow me to do so properly.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "105": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5c3d83d541d18800a0980b4f9dbf3fb72710d84bb3fc360dcb3b7545a76a4ecb",
      "text": "...No, really... Thank you too.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "109": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d43cc2b22784a357b0834fbd9833a6be6951f4aae41572466344fe1da2eaeb1b",
      "text": "If you ever have trouble, tell us\nany time. We will help.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "114": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d5d5beb476a951c7bee6bedd3d9ce4508c2655d90de7d6a5c342f504f66299cc",
      "text": "Yes! ...Ah.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "117": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bde3f1d144767b17759faf9d2a2b127d9fc2e40e8db262880eb132669f0b3c48",
      "text": "In that case, there is something I\nwould like to ask. If it is\npossible...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "119": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8b1488fd3895757ab75623aa829cda6335af5eba925bf830bda4e4371014cf92",
      "text": "Might you introduce me to some of\nthe strong ones in Starview\nVillage?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "124": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b3c54708adba1328d8529c72273ce3dbbeee6aa612908281c26182f21917f772",
      "text": "You mean, like... a training\njourney?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "127": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:771c1875c1c3228f3188dc13164deb3030597ec90f210e8e1b34e39f70f55ac9",
      "text": "The best way to grow stronger is to\nlearn from those who are strong.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "129": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:440c5c19af27a8907bb9722e55a55d72ab34baab9781c5771a423393642b15bd",
      "text": "Ten years for a single sword. Not to\nboast, but I was a swordswoman of some\nnote in Japan. My power, as you see.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "134": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1f4f118fc2dd59c53e79a41e5df62aa9110ac6e87f56beeef7455e89bdbca003",
      "text": "A power that creates swords...? For\na young person from Shibuya, it's\nquite, well...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "137": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cb687e4615cf995c0dbe4be7e7284fce4c1ab78c3158d00998adb005838bb103",
      "text": "It is a dangerous power, I think so\nmyself. But I also accept it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "140": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2198784391cdcb3c3f8d0b4110d2ec7b038112c3077299cb8eba7d8e4381941a",
      "text": "...To make myself a blade, hone it,\nand reach heights I never could in\nJapan. As a swordswoman, I crave it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "143": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e4187bd14f8bb7985d7c2146a7722785f7cb9f6db7a86052e43ee541b1261c4b",
      "text": "Besides, in a world like this,\nstrength is necessary, is it not?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "148": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7793c8f2765c6652d3bf6a9e9b54b66a2fa4d02e0a21b205a3440bde10bfa25c",
      "text": "You want to get stronger?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "152": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9f27b5bc75b8a09136254df97664a5f5f34b9c4e94340707f0c19ef68a0148a7",
      "text": "...Put plainly, yes.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "156": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7986b058efde5583c7a2d991455cd860137737680fcda809644b6a73a31347fa",
      "text": "Well... I do know a few people who\nmight get along with you, or whose\ngoals match yours...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "162": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:42ed4d416008653151e2b8f0d12ccb53d6b54348b979e973baf3b96391190aac",
      "text": "Nagi, wazzup! You finally got to\ntalk to Alk! That's great...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "169": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:abe63eb34c097428bf7defcb420530bafeae5cbca99f64baf8e3f4c24f185f46",
      "text": "W-what— Y-Yae...!! Don't say\nunnecessary things!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "173": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0e8d76597586a11483edb475fd0557d97e35029033903cb8c7568a58a41ce0ec",
      "text": "Nagi is a fan of you guys.\n\"Shibuya's heroes!\"",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "178": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:80989477b398d6e0d7f084e651beb5b2622f965210347518d573f07778a384da",
      "text": "One more word and our friendship is\nover!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "181": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0c401d7fe842957bcef25498a254ae448c2a728eb3fd88f33f4fcb77652fcd38",
      "text": "N-no, that is not it! I do not have\nsuch shallow feelings, never...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "185": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4ddeb6b7755e9eb2df3b1651cf13e02d8e9010763836188f77a2dcec27e64664",
      "text": "No, that is, I truly respect you\nall for saving Shibuya! But that is\nrespect and admiration!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "190": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a7d62a8b444607bd8b64b803115e6741c4e6f5c02fc2cd59b0abca13395814bf",
      "text": "Yes. You are welcome here, Nagiri.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "195": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4b39280cc47b5523d56ce0c40d05e9771ebbee2f560214f62812a937b77cf1e9",
      "text": "Want to come to Starview Village,\nthen?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "200": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4bbdfa0ea6c31dd13440e9b074fb3cabde3a00fd7ea71003f41f56442db42f41",
      "text": "...I will go!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "207": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1d79b3eb0d54b63a4329d7d159d4be7b39867f3fea9cdd9704a12e3dafe29f75",
      "text": "I see, so this is Starview\nVillage... A peaceful, lovely\nplace.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "210": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7c29f72060811eb89deeb13a15d1c6c18aca9dd5d3144cbe572d8736a5fd3652",
      "text": "You can come any time, but just so\nyou know, about this place...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "215": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:933919a02bcfa5f990a358604941a3850a43ec5c197e5e0c7b0f3dd2518408c2",
      "text": "It is the most secret of secrets. I\nwill not tell even the Guild\nKnights.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "220": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:40893e6f562b1029d98b1ccf5113707c860739e6d7507a1a8ba9dd3dd802a52c",
      "text": "Oh? Someone's already here?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "224": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4e6a4185168d616f3ebded64c58caccf4f227daf4bd67e60948cda798530ee11",
      "text": "...A samurai?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "228": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b3dcb9a252b2e74d3298c1f37549063da70adf39329a2d91546d60caf4507afe",
      "text": "Just a humble ronin, I'm afraid.\n...Do you wield a sword as well?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "233": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:86e14f489bd77b801c492522ffe065c2bcf69362d13455057c03065fff53248f",
      "text": "Y-yes! I am Nagiri Amo!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "235": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bf66cff6bdfa70c0e4afe7f512f2b106749e93771fe92c433a8a03a81c87574f",
      "text": "...I cannot think of you as a\n\"humble ronin\" with that sword\naura. What kind of world is yours—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "239": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1bcb470f41a958923a2a5c0a23a7345d4918d5e21ad6629eea724ff920234d92",
      "text": "Here, I might...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
